Source common.tape
Output semantic_tableau.mp4
Env SCENE_FILE "prime/Prime.lean:8"
Source open.tape

Type "10gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Type "13gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Type "16gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Ctrl+B Right Sleep 500ms
Type@400ms "jjllk"
Sleep 3s
